    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/c271143f9d7e3e8164c6727edb358866.poster.avif?t=1740693288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/c271143f9d7e3e8164c6727edb358866.webm?t=1740693288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/c271143f9d7e3e8164c6727edb358866.mp4?t=1740693288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong><br><br>Do you want to play a strategy game, managing resources, adapting services, handling issues like map space and events? Yes, in this game you can. Do you just want to relax and build more and more buildings without problems? Yes, you can do that too! Square City Builder offers dynamic gameplay that adapts to each player's style.<br><br><strong>BUILD, BUILD, AND BUILD</strong><br><br>There are so many buildings in this game that provide hours of gameplay. You can place various levels of residential, commercial, or industrial buildings, each with their own characteristics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/5dda32a64a9d8bb7efad106d9cba2574.poster.avif?t=1740693288\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/5dda32a64a9d8bb7efad106d9cba2574.apng?t=1740693288\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><strong>A NEW FORM OF SCORING</strong><br><br>In this game, you won't manage money to build, but to destroy. It's necessary to create a good strategy to manage the needs of constructions and the limited map space. On top of everything, events can change the course of things entirely and make everything more interesting...<br><br><strong>A CLASSIC CITY BUILDER AESTHETIC!</strong><br><br>Yes, in this game, you can reminisce about the old times when 2D city builders dominated this genre of games. It's a pixel art aesthetic greatly inspired by those times, bringing back that nostalgic feeling!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/d9d995d753e586f291cb9297defdfa3b.poster.avif?t=1740693288\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/d9d995d753e586f291cb9297defdfa3b.apng?t=1740693288\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><strong>CURRENT FEATURES</strong><br><br>Random map generator.<br>Custom weather seasons.<br>Events to face and deal with during the game, making the gameplay dynamic.<br>Various buildings such as businesses, residences, farms, roads, and much more.<br>Three game modes, with customizable rules by the player.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/c271143f9d7e3e8164c6727edb358866.poster.avif?t=1740693288\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/c271143f9d7e3e8164c6727edb358866.webm?t=1740693288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/c271143f9d7e3e8164c6727edb358866.mp4?t=1740693288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong><br><br>Do you want to play a strategy game, managing resources, adapting services, handling issues like map space and events? Yes, in this game you can. Do you just want to relax and build more and more buildings without problems? Yes, you can do that too! Square City Builder offers dynamic gameplay that adapts to each player's style.<br><br><strong>BUILD, BUILD, AND BUILD</strong><br><br>There are so many buildings in this game that provide hours of gameplay. You can place various levels of residential, commercial, or industrial buildings, each with their own characteristics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/5dda32a64a9d8bb7efad106d9cba2574.poster.avif?t=1740693288\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/5dda32a64a9d8bb7efad106d9cba2574.apng?t=1740693288\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><strong>A NEW FORM OF SCORING</strong><br><br>In this game, you won't manage money to build, but to destroy. It's necessary to create a good strategy to manage the needs of constructions and the limited map space. On top of everything, events can change the course of things entirely and make everything more interesting...<br><br><strong>A CLASSIC CITY BUILDER AESTHETIC!</strong><br><br>Yes, in this game, you can reminisce about the old times when 2D city builders dominated this genre of games. It's a pixel art aesthetic greatly inspired by those times, bringing back that nostalgic feeling!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/d9d995d753e586f291cb9297defdfa3b.poster.avif?t=1740693288\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561770/extras/d9d995d753e586f291cb9297defdfa3b.apng?t=1740693288\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><strong>CURRENT FEATURES</strong><br><br>Random map generator.<br>Custom weather seasons.<br>Events to face and deal with during the game, making the gameplay dynamic.<br>Various buildings such as businesses, residences, farms, roads, and much more.<br>Three game modes, with customizable rules by the player.",
    "short_description": "Build the small pixel city of your dreams! From classic city-building games, Square City Builder offers various ways to customize your gameplay, from constructing houses, farms, or roads to facing random events. In this game, you're in control!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Russian, Czech, Italian, Bulgarian, Korean, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Hungarian, Indonesian, Norwegian, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Arabic",
